OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785334695
OL,3,CCriminal Cases Review Commission told
OL,4,Cto deal with Fordingbridge rape
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FThe Criminal Cases Review Commission
OL,8,Fhas been asked to take "steps" in the
OL,9,Fcases of three boys who were
OL,10,Foriginally spared custody over the
OL,11,Frape of two girls in Fordingbridge.
OL,13,FTwo 15-year-old boys, known as X and
OL,14,FY, and another aged 14 known as Z,
OL,15,Fwere previously given non-custodial
OL,16,Fsentences in May for a combined 10
OL,17,Fcounts of rape and seven indecent
OL,18,Fimage offences related to two victims,
OL,19,Fwho were separately attacked in the
OL,20,FHampshire town in November 2024 and
OL,21,FJanuary 2025.
OL,26,@pD@XOUpD@^O]
