OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785334695
OL,3,CCriminal Cases Review Commission told
OL,4,Cto deal with Fordingbridge rape
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FOne of two girls raped by teenage boys
OL,8,Fin Fordingbridge has said she does not
OL,9,Fthink she "will ever be the same".
OL,11,FJazmine - not her real name - said
OL,12,Fthat the trial of her attackers "broke
OL,13,Fsomething inside me".
OL,15,FAt a short hearing on Tuesday, three
OL,16,Fjudges at the Court of Appeal ruled
OL,17,Fthat the Criminal Cases Review
OL,18,FCommission (CCRC) should investigate
OL,19,Fmatters that could be relevant to the
OL,20,Fconviction appeals, including
OL,21,Fpotentially the actions of some jurors.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785334695
OL,3,CCriminal Cases Review Commission told
OL,4,Cto deal with Fordingbridge rape
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FLord Justice Edis said: "The court has
OL,8,Fdirected it should exercise its
OL,9,Fpower... to direct the CCRC to carry
OL,10,Fout the steps set out in the draft
OL,11,Forder."
OL,13,FThe judge, sitting with Mr Justice
OL,14,FSoole and Judge Usha Karu, said that
OL,15,Fthe CCRC should report back to the
OL,16,FCourt of Appeal "for further
OL,17,Fdirections".
OL,19,FLord Justice Edis later said that the
OL,20,Fcourt intended to "deal with the cases
OL,21,Fas ones that ought to be expedited".
OL,26,@oD@YOUsD@GO]xD@QOUyD@KO]|D@SOU}D@cO]
