FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785334695
OL,3,CCriminal Cases Review Commission told
OL,4,Cto deal with Fordingbridge rape
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,FIn a summary of the decision to
OL,8,Fincrease X and Y's sentences, Baroness
OL,9,FCarr said: "We have made this decision
OL,10,Fbecause we think that what you both
OL,11,Fdid was so bad that we have no other
OL,12,Fchoice."
OL,14,FShe added: "Even though you will not
OL,15,Fbe in detention for the whole of the
OL,16,Ffour-year sentence, we know that it
OL,17,Fwill still be a long time for you to
OL,18,Fbe away from your home and families.
OL,26,@qD@LOUtD@HO]vD@LOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785334695
OL,3,CCriminal Cases Review Commission told
OL,4,Cto deal with Fordingbridge rape
OL,5,Csentences
OL,7,F"But what you both did was so bad that
OL,8,Fwe decided that we had no other choice
OL,9,Fthan to make these sentences."
OL,11,FThe families of the girls said they
OL,12,Fwere "deeply grateful" and "relieved"
OL,13,Fafter the decision to increase the
OL,14,Fsentences.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@^O]tD@FOUtD@VO]tD@\OUtD@eO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
